// # aarch64 tier 1 port status — coverage matrix and missing ports
//
// Logline: Records the done or in-flight state, line count, smoke presence, and reference path for every Tier 1 aarch64 port so a reader can see what ships and what still needs work.
//
// Setup: Source paths are anchored at /home/jeryd/Projects/openOODA. Emit modules live under ooda/oodac/aarch64_emit_*.oo. Smoke scripts live under ooda/scripts/aarch64_*_smoke.oo. Line counts are from wc -l at audit time. Smoke Y means a wiring-lock script exists; no compiler was run.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Inventory all 14 Tier 1 ports from the plan and map each to a module file.
