//   4. List the missing-port rows and the blocked-port rows so the next worker has a clear queue.

File: openOODA/audit/aarch64-tier1-status.oot
Status: open — Tier 1 audit snapshot. The aarch64 backend grows one port at a time. Three ports still have no emit module at all.
Context: Read-only audit. No .oo files were modified. No compiler was invoked. No tmp files were written.

